 "text": "Hey, nice to hear from you. How are you? There are few family friendly ones out there. Have you tried the ear club for young listeners? It' read like story with sound effects and short episodes for little ones. They are, and there are few episodes to get through. Definitely ear club. There are also some classic story podcasts like The Man Who Was Fearful, which is great for ten year olds. It' nice for them to listen together too, though. Set up shared account and co explore together. I' sure she will. Lots of little ones are curious about the world and podcasts are a great way to talk about it.",
